-- ============================================================================
-- Era aug boost (LDoN -> UF) -- raise era-defining augs to the soul-aug standard
-- Date: 2026-10-04
--
-- Benchmark: Lost-soul caps from aug_generator.py (hp/mana 2.0*L, ac 0.35*L):
-- era targets L65=283, L70=305, L75=327, L80=348, L85=370 (hp+mana+ac).
-- Source tiers: random-trash 50%, mini-boss 75%, main-boss/quest-epic 100% of
-- the era target. Per group: F_g = target / max (or target / P75 when the
-- group's strongest item already overshoots the target); per item:
-- F_i = clamp(target / total, 1, F_g) -- nothing is nerfed, nothing exceeds
-- its tier target, gradation below the anchor is preserved.
--
-- Every UPDATE covers the base row and its (Enchanted)/(Legendary) tier rows
-- (id+1000000 / id+2000000; no-op where absent) so Custom:DoItemUpgrades and
-- Khael the Spellforger hand out current stats. Proc/focus/dodge effects and
-- vendor economy are untouched. RUN ONCE -- the scaling is multiplicative.
-- Sentinel for the migration check: Solid Coal of Prowess (42205) hp = 283.
-- Twin of ManifestEntry .version = 100 in
-- common/database/database_update_manifest_custom.cpp
-- ============================================================================
